A. Commit message:
cifs: Backport fix for integer overflow while processing acdirmax mount option

B. Change summary:
Backported the fix to prevent an integer overflow when processing the acdirmax mount parameter by ensuring validation occurs before converting seconds to jiffies.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Low

